    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30382" root="علن" body-key="E">
    
      Q. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلْوَنْتُ الكِتَابَ</span></b> , (S,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلْوَنَةٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُلْوَانٌ</span>, (K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">علو</span>,) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْوَنْتُهُ</span> [i. e. <i>I put a
title to the book,</i> or <i>writing</i>]: (S:) it may be of
the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعْوَلْتُ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَلَانِيةُ</span>, or the former
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> in <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْوَنْتُ</span> may be a substitute for the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ل</span> in
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلْوَنْتُ</span> [or the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ل</span> for the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span>]: Lth says that it is
not a good word. (TA.) [It is also mentioned
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">علو</span>.]

